  "body": "Hello,\r\n\r\nIs there any way that a web application could leverage this web-bluetooth API to transfer an URL between another instance of the web application on another device? Both applications would have the same origin.\r\nIf my understanding of BLE is correct, then this would involve simulating a GATT service on one of the devices, as it is done in the native application [ble-test-peripheral-android](https://github.com/WebBluetoothCG/ble-test-peripheral-android)?",
